    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>https://tejdabhankar.github.io/partialreconfig/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://tejdabhankar.github.io/partialreconfig/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Hello! I’m &lt;strong&gt;Tej Dabhankar&lt;/strong&gt;, an electronics engineer who loves exploring how things work — both professionally and as a hobby.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I’m deeply interested in &lt;strong&gt;hardware, computation, and FPGA systems&lt;/strong&gt;, and currently diving into &lt;strong&gt;RTL design&lt;/strong&gt; to understand computation from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In my free time, I enjoy &lt;strong&gt;exploring nature&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;trekking&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;cycling&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;bike riding&lt;/strong&gt;. Sometimes, when I need a change of pace, I &lt;strong&gt;write&lt;/strong&gt; — about technology, ideas, or anything that sparks curiosity.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
